Pilgrimage: Shrine of the Shelter~
Visit Shrine of the Shelter, then report to the temple priest.~
Walk from the public courtyard of Mishakal to Shrine of the Shelter. Reflect on its lesson, then return to the priest and use religion task turnin.
~
You have completed the pilgrimage.
~
You leave this pilgrimage for another day.
~
